Z||000000||zeusrekning||09-18-2000||04:58 PM||||here to update. I got a pontiac 455 saturday and 400 tranny out of local junk yard. Guy who owns it is a friend of my g/f's dad and he had no info on it (he also thought it was a 400). But any way i got the engine and tranny for $000 dollars yes zero.We thought the engine would be blown or tore up bad because the guy who used to own it raced it . Don't know why but the guy at the junkyard knew that.But we got it to the shop and it would spin over using a breaker bar. The bores were still stock. one piston had a hole in it. The engine is in very good shape compared to how i thought it would be. <BR>Now i need heads. it had a set of 140 heads on it but i want something better.||||reg||14
